				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:13" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ちなみに　正体は
ヒヒダルマっていう　ポケモンね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-09T01:51:54" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
