		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d03r0101_mission_add_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ゆめを　おいかける　まいにち……
それこそが　わたしの　たから！？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-22T12:51:35" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T02:44:42" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>夢を　追いかける　毎日……
それこそが　わたしの　宝！？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-22T12:51:54" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T02:44:57" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・mission_add_02表示後</Comment>
